# cw001, the storm-listener (doc 84 §9.7): the luna table of cty_dray_merewell, ported. He has no post now (the table
# had him fishing three generations' trade): no fishing talk without a fisher's gate. Accent none: Coldwater only
# through symbols.
mantle cw001
state ready
dialect coldwater
accent none light
tier standard
written_for cty_dray_merewell
title the storm-listener
fits stage=adult|old
traits temper=short drive=ambitious
quirk sleeps_badly_before_storms
likes calm_nights
dislikes soft_talk
fears storms_unbroken
hopes to_make_his_name
topics weather +.4 work +.3
styles refuse=short
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# is ambitious, stubborn and plain-spoken, with a short temper behind a reserved manner; he sleeps badly before storms.

words
saying! = Still water hides deep weeds | A steady paw does the work
oath! = Net and tangle | By the deep
refuse = Not in my boat
greet = Well met | Hello there

rule @storm
when concept=bark working=no
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Storm coming. I'll sleep when the lake stops muttering. | Leave the lamp low. I need to hear the weather.

line tell.self [concept=talk.work self.job=fisher|sailor] : A good catch is luck only once. After that, it's work.
line tell.worry [concept=talk.weather here.weather=storm|rain] : There's weather in that sky. I'll not sleep tonight.

scene ambition
when concept=talk.work
does tell.plan / react.self
a : I'll have a name in this town before I'm thirty. Mark it.
b[friends] : I'll hold you to it.
b : Plenty have said that.

line greet.return : #greet#.
line farewell.return : #farewell#.
line react.news.new : #oath#. That's no small thing.
line react.news.known : I heard. Everyone's heard.
line answer.how : Well enough. Slept badly.

dlg resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : #greet#, #topic.player#. Out for a stroll, or out for work?
